Tall Stack\'92s figures come from Poly Pizza: the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://poly.pizza/m/6dM1J6f6pm9"}}{\fldrslt cat}}, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://poly.pizza/m/cx0-TiCjDOx"}}{\fldrslt elephant}}, and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://poly.pizza/m/80w8kwQU0QH"}}{\fldrslt giraffe}} by Poly by Google and the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://poly.pizza/m/nx9Cqdzq97"}}{\fldrslt phone booth}} by Zsky, under {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/"}}{\fldrslt CC BY 3.0}}; and the house by Kenney, the windmill and the castle tower (\'93Stone Tower\'94) by Quaternius, and the lighthouse by MaverickFX, under CC0.\
